#
# A100 job: the hpc_a100 group cells at euclid.
# Likelihood-lifecycle phase 2d multi_galaxy + group campaign (autolens_profiling#473), batch 1: 14 cell(s).
# Decisions D1-D12 adopted by the human 2026-10-29 (wiki/campaigns/multi_galaxy/
# likelihood_lifecycle_p2d.md); batch 1 needs the human's batch go.
# GENERATED by scripts/misc/campaigns/multi_galaxy_group_p2d.py --write; edit the generator,
# not this file (the campaign test fails on a hand edit). The batch procedure is in
# scripts/misc/campaigns/README.md.
#
# LIBRARY CODE. A private checkout of the five libraries at tag 2026.10.25.1 ($PYAUTO_PRIVATE_BASE,
# default /mnt/ral/jnightin/profiling/PyAuto_2026.10.25.1) is prepended to PYTHONPATH over the shared venv
# ($PYAUTO_HPC_BASE, default /mnt/ral/jnightin/PyAuto, third-party packages only). The job refuses to
# run if a library imports from anywhere else or sits at another tag, and after each leg it
# checks the row's library_revisions equal the checkout's HEADs. The shared mirror is never
# pulled or used. AP_ROOT is the checkout this was submitted from (hpc/<batch>/../..).
#
# CELLS. Every leg runs one cell script of the shared galaxy/group driver on the standard
# cell (MGE source, or Delaunay 1250 + 30 edge / rectangular 35x35) and writes its row
# (runtime legs also parity.json and fit.png) into the mirrored cell named by --output-path
# under the gitignored output/p2d_batch1/ scratch tree, never in place over results/.
#
# MEMORY. --mem=16gb from batch 0's sacct MaxRSS on the bounding group legs
# (3.0 GiB in 413294_1) x 1.5, at least 16 GB.
# One A100 job runs this dataset type's hpc_a100 cells in turn. The jax_cpu_sparse legs
# run on the GPU node's CPU inside this GPU job (JAX_PLATFORMS=cpu, NPROC=8): the
# hpc_a100 host class's CPU setup, never a CPU array on the gpu partition.
#
# WALL-BASIS: measured by batch 0 on the bounding group leg of the same script, setup
# and host class; --time is 1.25x the submit's total (1666s) plus
# 15 min of slack, rounded up to the next 30 min.
#   7 leg(s): delaunay jax_cpu_sparse_fp64 breakdown, delaunay jax_gpu_dense_fp64 breakdown, delaunay jax_gpu_sparse_fp64 breakdown, mge jax_gpu_dense_fp64 breakdown, rectangular jax_cpu_sparse_fp64 breakdown, rectangular jax_gpu_dense_fp64 breakdown, rectangular jax_gpu_sparse_fp64 breakdown
#   cell: group/likelihood_breakdown/euclid  device: a100  precision: fp64
#   source: measured-wall  wall: 877  ref: 413294_0,413294_10,413294_12,413294_2,413294_4,413294_6,413294_8  measured-on: euclid  headroom: 1.25  median: included
#   7 leg(s): delaunay jax_cpu_sparse_fp64 runtime, delaunay jax_gpu_dense_fp64 runtime, delaunay jax_gpu_sparse_fp64 runtime, mge jax_gpu_dense_fp64 runtime, rectangular jax_cpu_sparse_fp64 runtime, rectangular jax_gpu_dense_fp64 runtime, rectangular jax_gpu_sparse_fp64 runtime
#   cell: group/likelihood_runtime/euclid  device: a100  precision: fp64
#   source: measured-wall  wall: 789  ref: 413294_1,413294_11,413294_13,413294_3,413294_5,413294_7,413294_9  measured-on: euclid  headroom: 1.25  median: included

